## INTERCEPTS:

it1_h ~ 0*1 + nu.1*1
it2_h ~ 0*1 + nu.2*1
it3_h ~ 0*1 + nu.3*1
it4_h ~ 0*1 + nu.4*1
it5_h ~ 0*1 + nu.5*1
it6_h ~ 0*1 + nu.6*1
it1_t ~ NA*1 + nu.7*1
it2_t ~ NA*1 + nu.8*1
it3_t ~ NA*1 + nu.9*1
it4_t ~ NA*1 + nu.10*1
it5_t ~ NA*1 + nu.11*1
it6_t ~ NA*1 + nu.12*1

## UNIQUE-FACTOR VARIANCES:

it1_h ~~ 1*it1_h + theta.1_1*it1_h
it2_h ~~ 1*it2_h + theta.2_2*it2_h
it3_h ~~ 1*it3_h + theta.3_3*it3_h
it4_h ~~ 1*it4_h + theta.4_4*it4_h
it5_h ~~ 1*it5_h + theta.5_5*it5_h
it6_h ~~ 1*it6_h + theta.6_6*it6_h
it1_t ~~ NA*it1_t + theta.7_7*it1_t
it2_t ~~ NA*it2_t + theta.8_8*it2_t
it3_t ~~ NA*it3_t + theta.9_9*it3_t
it4_t ~~ NA*it4_t + theta.10_10*it4_t
it5_t ~~ NA*it5_t + theta.11_11*it5_t
it6_t ~~ NA*it6_t + theta.12_12*it6_t

## UNIQUE-FACTOR COVARIANCES:

it1_h ~~ NA*it1_t + theta.7_1*it1_t
it2_h ~~ NA*it2_t + theta.8_2*it2_t
it3_h ~~ NA*it3_t + theta.9_3*it3_t
it4_h ~~ NA*it4_t + theta.10_4*it4_t
it5_h ~~ NA*it5_t + theta.11_5*it5_t
it6_h ~~ NA*it6_t + theta.12_6*it6_t

## LATENT MEANS/INTERCEPTS:

Fh ~ 0*1 + alpha.1*1
Ft ~ 0*1 + alpha.2*1

## COMMON-FACTOR VARIANCES:

Fh ~~ 1*Fh + psi.1_1*Fh
Ft ~~ 1*Ft + psi.2_2*Ft

## COMMON-FACTOR COVARIANCES:

Fh ~~ NA*Ft + psi.2_1*Ft

